Page Name: Pre-Event Portal
Slug: pre-event

What it is:
A participant-facing portal page that prepares someone for their upcoming Landmark Forum.

Who it is visible to:
Logged-in participants with an active Landmark Forum registration who have not yet started their Forum.

When someone accesses it:
After completing registration and verifying their account, typically through the portal login, a confirmation email, or a pre-event reminder.

Purpose:
To give participants everything they need before their Forum, including event details, preparation guidance, agreements, FAQs, calendar access, support resources, and contact information.
